  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.2 - Reliable example file hyperlinks. The example bundles its README beside the executable on build and publish, and resolves its file URI from AppContext.BaseDirectory instead of the launch directory. Updated hyperlink documentation and release metadata. Native OSC 8 output and opt-in ordinary-click activation from 1.11.1 are unchanged. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
